	(text "RECEIVER: VCC + V_IO tied to +3.3V; VIO_SEL open = 3.3 V I/O (IM 4.1.2).\nC43/C44 beside pins 7/8, short GND vias; no series R > 0.2 ohm in VCC (IM 4.1.1).\nRESET_N, EXTINT, SCL, SAFEBOOT_N, LNA_EN left open (DS Table 10).\nSDA = ANT_SHORT_N (IM 3.3.1.2): CFG-HW-ANT_CFG_SHORTDET=1, ANT_SUP_SHORT_PIN=SDA PIO.\nPPS: TIMEPULSE = SAFEBOOT_N via 1k inside (DS fn 15); nothing may hold it\nlow at power-up, so no pull-down. R42 limits a shorted J14 to ~7 mA (I_PIO 10 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e041638-f9e9-486c-8f8d-974e2a89418a")
	)
	(text "ANTENNA: RF_IN is DC-blocked inside the module (IM Table 1), no external DC block.\nBias-T VCC_RF -> U13 TPS22941 -> R40 10R -> C45 10n -> L3 27 nH onto RF line (IM 3.3.1.2, 4.3.4).\nU13: I_LIM 40-80 mA, 5-20 ms blanking, 40-160 ms restart (TPS2294x DS 7.5): short avg <= 27 mA,\ntyp 7 mA (VCC_RF abs max 250 mA, DS Table 12). 25 mA antenna drop ~0.27 V -> ~2.9 V at J15.\nLayout: 50 ohm CPWG pin 11 -> J15, L3 pad on the line, >= 5 mm from digital.\nBACKUP: BT1 CR1220 (3 V, 35 mAh, user-fitted, NOT rechargeable, no charger) on V_BCKP;\nC46 1u at pin 6 (IM 4.1.3). 35 mAh / 28 uA (DS Table 17) = ~1250 h (~52 days) powered off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 186.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d07afcd4-1152-4eb6-adba-486c468470cf")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 196.85 73.66)
		(end 284.48 111.76)
		(stroke
			(width 0.254)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "ee47cedf-a19e-4861-afbf-f153eeb101b3")
	)
